{
  "reason": "To improve potency, I shifted from a linear peptidomimetic to a more compact, non-peptidic covalent scaffold. I retained a Michael acceptor for Cys145 but added a 3,4-dichlorophenyl group to better fill the hydrophobic S2 pocket and introduced a pyridyl amide and morpholine to increase polarity and beneficial heteroaromatic features highlighted by SHAP (heteroatoms in rings, O–C–N motifs) while avoiding long aliphatic chains that reduced pIC50.",
