  "reason": "Building on the improved potency, I kept the favorable dichloroaromatic and heteroatom-rich features but replaced the Michael acceptor with a nitrile warhead (a known Mpro covalent motif) and introduced a P1-like γ-lactam attached via an amide to better mimic glutamine binding. I also maintained a tertiary amine-containing solubilizing tail to preserve beneficial heteroatom–CH2 patterns highlighted by SHAP while avoiding extended conjugated alkenes that were slightly disfavored.",
